For the counter: "a per-instance counter zero-padded to six digits, starting at 1, advancing once per created order". AtomicLong incrementAndGet starting at 0 gives 1 first. Good. The imports already include `java.util.concurrent.atomic.AtomicLong`, `java.time.LocalDateTime`, `java.time.format.DateTimeFormatter`, `java.util.*` — confirming this design. 

